{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今晚，國家主席習近平和夫人彭麗媛在深圳國際交流中心舉行宴會，歡迎出席亞太經合組織第三十三次領導人非正式會議的來賓並集體合影。</p>\n<p>日本首相高市早苗在集體合影前，與中國國家主席習近平握手。這是高市去年發表涉台言論、導致中日關係急劇惡化以來，兩人首次面對面互動。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:24:19.105637+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T11:34:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T22:17:59.433155+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:25.992819+00:00","content_hash":"7fdace5a3a7f4cf5bad9ea7def0ffdcb81f1cb10fa5dc310df13452f2a3da777","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}